WEBVTT

00:00:09,100 --> 00:00:13,580
and participating in a clinical trial, what do I think about participating in clinical trials?

00:00:13,580 --> 00:00:18,540
I don't think participating in clinical trials is wrong at all. I think it's wrong if you don't

00:00:20,140 --> 00:00:25,420
for you, certainly would be wrong. You are doing everything you can naturally. But when you hear

00:00:25,420 --> 00:00:32,940
a person that's, you know, getting a very grave diagnosis, they've never even explored any natural

00:00:32,940 --> 00:00:39,260
things. And let's say it's a diagnosis that chemotherapy doesn't work well on. Let's say they have

00:00:41,580 --> 00:00:49,420
a cancer with a very low success rate with chemotherapy with other standards of care. And they're

00:00:49,420 --> 00:00:53,740
offered a clinical trial and they consider it immediately without trying natural things. I think

00:00:53,740 --> 00:00:58,940
that's kind of foolish. But if you're exhausting everything and you're doing everything in there,

00:00:58,940 --> 00:01:03,580
have some promise in a clinical trial that you feel like God is leading you, that that might be

00:01:03,580 --> 00:01:07,740
an answer by all means. I think you could pray about it. But if you feel like God has opened

00:01:07,740 --> 00:01:16,060
in your door or something, I think there's anything wrong with to call it walk you down that path.

